2	// routine 'status' narration out of game chat and into a Discord channel
3	// (user decree: status chatter -> Discord, game chat = real talk only).
4	//
5	// No deps: uses node:https directly. Every call is best-effort — a bad
6	// webhook, a network hiccup, or a slow Discord response never throws back
7	// into the caller; postStatus() always resolves, returning false on any
8	// failure (including the 2s timeout) and true on a 2xx response.
9	//
10	// Usage:
11	//   import { postStatus, isConfigured } from './discord.mjs';
12	//   if (isConfigured(localCfg)) {
